# The server's IP and SSH user never land in source control.
inventory.ini

# One-time bootstrap credentials and local secret material.
# .secrets/ holds: the hosting provider's one-time root password, the new
# root password you chose, and the Ansible Vault password that decrypts
# group_vars/all/vault.yml on this control machine.
.secrets/
vault-pass
.bootstrap-*

# group_vars/all/vault.yml is deliberately NOT ignored: it is encrypted with
# Ansible Vault, and committing it is how Semaphore and your teammates get
# the secrets. Committing it UNENCRYPTED is what the gitleaks workflow exists
# to catch — if `head -1 group_vars/all/vault.yml` does not start with
# $ANSIBLE_VAULT, do not commit.
